  "reasoning": "The defendants stole 300 meters of telecom cable, which is a public telecommunication facility. Under Chinese criminal law, the unlawful removal or destruction of such facilities constitutes the crime of ‘破坏公用电信设施罪’. The dataset’s labeling convention omits the trailing “罪” for this offense, as seen with similar labels (e.g., 破坏计算机信息系统). Therefore the appropriate label is ‘破坏公用电信设施’. No other crimes (e.g., generic theft) are required because the special statutory offense covers the conduct.",
